# Android: the generated android/ tree IS committed (Capacitor shell —
# the signing config, version file and icon wiring are reviewable, not
# generated blind in CI). Build outputs and local config live in
# android/.gitignore.
#
# Keystores and installers — NEVER commit. The release keystore lives
# offline with its custodian + as base64 in GitHub Secrets. (The old
# debug keystore was committed to this public repo — see
# docs/ANDROID_RELEASE.md §5 — which is why these rules exist.)
*.jks
*.keystore
*.apk
*.aab
google-services.json
